# SDD Bugfix Skill

When activated for a bug/incident task:

1. Read `docs/for-agents/sdd-development-methodology.md`, section "ШАБЛОН 2" (Bug Fix / Incident), and follow it literally.
2. Root cause first, exact `file:line`, no silent `try/except: pass` masking.
3. Create a regression test that reproduces the bug.{% if test_command %} Run `{{ test_command }}` — the test MUST fail (RED) before touching implementation code.{% endif %}
{%- if code_intelligence != "none" %}
4. Check blast radius via {{ code_intelligence }} before the point-fix.
{%- endif %}
5. Confirm the regression test goes GREEN and the rest of the suite still passes.
6. Final report must state: root cause (`file:line`), the RED→GREEN test name{% if code_intelligence != "none" %}, impact-analysis output{% endif %}, and whether `bash bin/sdd_verify.sh` passed.
